---
title: Sticky Miso Tofu
servings: 2
prep-time: 20 minutes
cook-time: 40 minutes
tags: [tofu, vegan, easyrecipe, miso, dinnerideas]
source: https://www.instagram.com/reel/CsABQPapIVU/
image: https://scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/504088559_719760333978794_7045369343882533608_n.jpg?stp=cmp1_dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=KQtyeswppKAQ7kNvwFIOGNB&_nc_oc=AdlhmVyCSy94VKHGMnRCDaja1tPFWVBPrBK0RADXElPHwbi4daftPUq3doYlnoPRfGA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=O-VdafunRG8_kKCRhFurew&oh=00_AfqgAGhrbb_jY3dyHd3rF8Y8l9-LWfaaksSupEhg9LjMmA&oe=6978BA6A
---

Preheat your oven to 425°F. In a large bowl, tear the pressed @tofu{400%g, block, pressed and drained} into 1 inch chunks. Drizzle with @tamari{1%tbsp, marinade} and @avocado oil{1.5%tbsp, marinade}, then evenly sprinkle @cornstarch{1%tbsp, coating}, @nutritional yeast{1%tbsp, coating}, @white pepper{0.25%tsp, coating}, and @five spice{0.25%tsp, coating, optional}. Toss the tofu to evenly coat.

Spread the tofu in an even layer on a #baking tray{} and place in the oven to bake for ~{30%minutes}, flipping halfway.

Meanwhile, in a measuring cup, add @yellow miso paste{2%tsp, for sauce}, @brown sugar{2%tbsp, for sauce}, @tamari{2%tbsp, miso sauce, or coconut aminos}, and @mirin{2%tbsp}. With a spoon, lightly mash the mixture together. Add @water{0.25%cup, for sauce} and vigorously whisk until smooth.

In a separate small bowl whisk @cornstarch{2%tsp, slurry} with @water{2%tbsp} until smooth.

Heat a skillet with @avocado oil{2%tsp, for cooking} over medium heat. Once hot, add @scallions{2%scallions, white portions separated}, @garlic{2%cloves, thinly sliced}, @ginger{1%tsp, grated}, and @fresno pepper{1%whole, thinly sliced} and sauté until fragrant. Pour the miso sauce into the pan and stir well into the aromatics until it starts to simmer. Pour in the cornstarch slurry, turn the heat to low then continue to stir for ~{5%minutes} or until the sauce begins to thicken to your liking. Stir in @tofu{400%g, block} and coat with the sauce.

Serve garnished with @scallions{2%scallions, green portions} and enjoy as desired.